  "title": "Atakilt Wat (Ethiopian Cabbage and Potatoes)",
  "description": "Atakilt wat is an Ethiopian side dish featuring carrots, onions, potatoes, and cabbage simmered with fragrant spices such as turmeric, cumin, and ginger.",
